{"code":"008600","name":"윌비스","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"섬유,의류,신발,호화품","sector_desc":"의류·신발 제조(OEM 포함)와 브랜드. 소비 경기와 해외 바이어 주문, 환율에 영향을 받습니다.","desc":"동사는 1973년 의복제조업을 주사업목적으로 설립되었으며, 1989년 유가증권시장에 상장하였음. 현재 14개의 비상장 종속회사를 보유하고 있으며, 인도네시아, 캄보디아, 도미니카공화국, 아이티 등에 해외 생산기지를 구축하고 있음. 섬유사업과 교육사업을 영위하며, 섬유사업은 OEM방식으로 의복을 생산하여 GAP, HANESBRANDS 등 글로벌 바이어에 수출하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-21","n_days":300,"close":2620.0,"open":2620.0,"high":2620.0,"low":2620.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":0.0,"ret_60":0.0,"ret_120":0.0,"ret_250":-19.3101,"ma20":2620.0,"ma60":2620.0,"ma120":2620.0,"ma200":2765.035,"close_vs_ma200":-5.2453,"close_vs_ma60":0.0,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":0.0,"r2_60":0.0,"slope_120":0.0,"r2_120":0.0,"slope_250":-28.6843,"r2_250":0.6407,"high52":5626.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":46.5695,"dd_52w":-53.4305,"mdd_1y":-41.6221,"atr14_pct":71.4286,"vol_ann_60":0.0,"vol_avg20":0.0,"vol_ratio20":null,"vr5":null,"vr20":null,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":0.0,"amount_avg60":0.0,"obv_chg20":null,"turnover_20":0.0,"pv_eff_20":null,"rsi14":34.5863,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":0.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_120":0.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0,"foreign_ratio":2.17,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.01,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-279.0,"op_margin_q":-67.5545,"op_qoq":-745.4545,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-9400.0,"rev_yoy":-23.2342,"op_trend_4q":-47.553,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-153.82,"debt_ratio":1909.7,"per":null,"pbr":1.43,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":2.17,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"nxt_change_pct":null,"cns_per":null,"code":"008600","name":"윌비스","market":"KOSPI","se